<title>BELARUS: Belarus February GDP rises 10 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Belarus February GDP rises 10 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross domestic product in Belarus grew three percent in February compared to the previous month, and 10 percent compared to year-ago levels, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said GDP totalled 38 trillion Belarussian roubles ($1.58 billion at current exchange rates) in the first two months.</p>
<p>				   Feb 97	 Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p> GDP growth (month/month)   +3.0	   -9.0	  +1.0</p>
<p> GDP growth (year/year)    +10.0	  +11.0	  -6.0</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom +38-044-229-2264</p>
